= Mechanism design — Simple =

Mechanism design asks how to design rules when participants act strategically. Instead of only asking “what will players do under these rules?”, it also asks “what rules make the desired behavior or outcome possible?”

'''Important boundary:''' mechanism design ≠ generic product design.

